/*
 * `ToriRSServer --selftest`: the whole game logic driven with no socket.
 *
 * Split out of torirs_server_world.c once it had grown larger than the world
 * it tests. The suite builds a world in process, drives it a tick at a time,
 * and asserts on what the encoders put on the wire — see
 * ToriRSServer_CaptureBegin. What it needs from the world proper it reaches
 * through torirs_server.h, or through torirs_server_world_internal.h, which
 * exists for exactly this pair of files.
 */
